		(uuid "0716f709-bfaa-423b-aa57-9844f518bb4c")
	)
	(text "Interface: frame-sync slave mode (FORMAT=1, FSMODE=0), daisy-chained (B DOUT -> A DAISYIN). The MCU SAI1 block B runs TDM: 32.768 MHz SCLK, 512 kHz FSYNC, 2 x 32-bit slots -> one DMA stream, zero CPU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1c39191b-8c66-48c6-967a-c4c9f4cdfe8c")
	)
	(text "Hardware straps: FILTER[1:0]=00 wideband-1, OSR[1:0]=00 (512 kSPS) are driven by MCU GPIO so firmware can drop to 256/128 kSPS for lower power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 374.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b613ed1a-7246-4ea6-83f8-315ca0b2652d")
	)
	(text "TX period = 100 samples (5.12 kHz fundamental); demodulation is an exact 100-point DFT per period at bins 1,2,3,4,8 (5.12/10.24/15.36/20.48/40.96 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d0841b6f-6823-435c-9fe1-ba69de34afca")
	)
	(text "ACQUISITION  (2 x ADS127L01, wideband-1 FIR, OSR 32 -> 512 kSPS each, 16.384 MHz clock from MCU MCO2 -> coherent with TX timers)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d6458d51-2891-4d7b-9282-091a7843d610")
	)
	(text "FORMAT=1 (frame-sync), FSMODE=0 (slave): FSYNC (512 kHz) and SCLK (32.768 MHz) come from SAI1_B; A's DOUT carries 48 bits per frame (A then B via DAISYIN). Daisy-chain is supported in frame-sync slave mode (DS 8.5.2.2.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 378.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f886b371-ddb0-491d-9361-99ac74639177")
	)
